{title: Tere Sang Yaara}
{artist: Atif Aslam Arko}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G] Tere sang yaara,        [C] Khush rang bahara
[Am] Tu raat deewani,        [G] Main zard sitara
[G] O karam khudaya hai,        [Em] Tujhe mujhse milaya hai
[G] Tujhpe marke hi toh,        [Em] Mujhe jeena aaya hai
[G] O tere sang yaara,        Khushrang [C] bahara
Tu raat [Am] deewani,        Main zard [G] sitara
[G] O tere sang yaara,        Khushrang [C] bahara
Main tera [Am] ho jaun,        Jo tu karde [G] ishara
[G] Kahi kisi bhi gali mein jaaun main,        [Em] Teri khushbu se takraun main
[Am] Har raat jo aata hai mujhe,        [D] Woh khwab tu..
[G] Tera mera milna dastoor hai,        [Em] Tere hone se mujhme noor hai
[Am] Main hoon soona sa ek aasmaan,        [D] Mehtaab tu..
[G] O karam khudaya hai,        [Em] Tujhe maine jo paaya hai
[G] Tujhpe marke hi toh,        [Em] Mujhe jeena aaya hai
[G] O tere sang yaara,        Khushrang [C] bahara
Tu raat [Am] deewani,        Main zard [G] sitara
[G] O tere sang yaara,        Khushrang [C] bahara
Tere bin [Am] ab toh,        Na jeena [G] ganvara
[G] Maine chhode hai baki saare rastein,        [Em] Bas aaya hun tere paas re
[Am] Meri ankhon me tera naam hai,        [D] Pehchaan le..
[G] Sab kuch mere liye tere baad hai,        [Em] Sau baaton ki ik baat hai
[Am] Main na jaunga kabhi tujhe chhod ke,        [D] Yeh jaane le..
[G] O karam khudaya hai,        [Em] Tera pyaar jo paaya hai
[G] Tujhpe marke hi toh,        [Em] Mujhe jeena aaya hai
[G] O tere sang yaara,        Khushrang [C] bahara
Tu raat [Am] deewani,        Main zard [G] sitara
[G] O tere sang yaara,        Khushrang [C] bahara
Main behta [Am] musafir,        Tu tehra [G] kinara
